mlx-vlm - https://github.com/Blaizzy/mlx-vlm

gmlx primarily uses mlx-vlm as an installed dependency, patched at runtime
(see gmlx/upstream/seams.py), but the modules below carry code copied or
ported from it, with modifications:

- gmlx/models/qwen35/language.py, gated_delta.py, config.py,
  moe_language.py and moe_config.py: the qwen3_5 and qwen3_5_moe text
  models of mlx-vlm 0.6.15 (mlx_vlm/models/qwen3_5/language.py,
  gated_delta.py, config.py and mlx_vlm/models/qwen3_5_moe/language.py,
  config.py), written by scripts/vendor_qwen35.py. Each file lists its
  edits in its docstring: absolute imports, the text configs only, a
  gmlx cache class in make_cache, evals under an except routed through
  gmlx.eval_guard, ASCII comments, a video-grid bug fix from mlx-vlm
  0.7.3, and mlx-lm's SwitchGLU in the MoE block.
- gmlx/cache/apc_manager.py: the store_kv_blocks override is a copy of
  mlx_vlm.apc.APCManager.store_kv_blocks with the per-block mx.eval
  hoisted into chunked batches and gmlx's checkpoint-store policy added.
- gmlx/gen/thinking_budget.py: ported from mlx-vlm's ThinkingBudgetCriteria
  stopping-criteria callback, reworked as an mlx-lm logits processor.
- gmlx/systemone/denoise.py: entropy_transfer_mask follows
  mlx_vlm.generate.diffusion._diffusion_entropy_transfer_mask.

